coordination/goals/GOAL-AES-003/batches/BATCH-009/tasks/TASK-20260803-a0a7b9/src/yoyo_sbox_v4

# NEVER IGNORE A TASK DIRECTORY. Ignore individual build products by path.
# Six directory-form entries were added here by be3a56c8 to keep a snapshot
# commit pure, and were never lifted. Reviewer reports written into those
# directories AFTERWARDS were therefore invisible to `git status`, and two
# independent BATCH-005 reviews (109 KB) survived only in an ephemeral
# container filesystem until CORR-20260803-ba2eb7 caught it. A directory
# ignore silently swallows artifacts that do not exist yet; a path ignore
# cannot. See CORR-20260803-ba2eb7.

# Stray root-level outputs from a failed nohup launch; see BATCH-005 note.
val_r6_M0.json
val_r6_M0.err
coordination/goals/GOAL-AES-003/batches/BATCH-007/tasks/TASK-20260803-e55757/rc8probe
coordination/goals/GOAL-AES-003/batches/BATCH-007/tasks/TASK-20260803-e55757/rc8probe_native

# Derived retrieval index (kb/). Object storage and the records in this
# repository are the source of truth; the staged corpus, the manifests, and
# the query log are all rebuildable with `make -C kb slice`.
kb/.kb-corpus/
kb/.kb-queries.jsonl
kb/.kb-index/
kb/.env

# `uv run` writes this when it builds the MCP server's environment. Not
# committed: it is one file every worktree rewrites, which is the conflict
# shape this repository removes elsewhere, and the reproducibility it would
# buy is not where this component's reproducibility lives -- the dense
# embedder is deterministic by construction and the evaluation corpus is
# frozen by manifest, so a resolver difference cannot move a measured result.
kb/uv.lock

